Lab-file parsers: plates (Bioqore lab analyses; idea credit)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: github.com/Bioqore/ad_hoc_data_analyses (commit 82e6ae0, 2026-06-24),
the lab's plate-map analyses.

Idea credit; re-implemented, no code copied. The ideas: a plate map that places
each sample on a culture plate and an analytics plate; joining instrument reads
to samples by plate and well position rather than by sample name; treating
"A01" and "A1" as the same well. Used in kalos/ingest/plates.py.

No data from that repository is included. The test fixtures are synthetic and
copy only the header layout of the lab's files.
